# Testing

- E2E tests live only under `e2e/` (outside `src/`). Use Playwright (`@playwright/test`) with Chromium and `*.spec.ts` names. Run with `pnpm test:e2e`.
- Unit tests live next to the covered file in a `tests/` folder, e.g. `src/entities/career-step/model/schema.ts` → `src/entities/career-step/tests/schema.test.ts`. Use Vitest Browser Mode (`pnpm test`). Pattern: `src/**/tests/**/*.test.ts(x)` and `worker/**/*.test.ts`.
- Do not put Playwright specs in `src/`. Do not use a root `tests/` tree or sibling `src/foo.test.ts` files.
